Kokoro 82M (kokoro-v1.0.onnx), and its voices

Kokoro-82M v1.0 by hexgrad (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M), under the Apache License 2.0 beside this
file, as exported to ONNX by onnx-community (https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX), the same
licence. Each voice's .bin is one of its voices, from the same export.

Its model card (MODEL_CARD) names the CC BY audio it was trained on, credited here:
- The SIWIS French Speech Synthesis Database (Honnet, Lazaridis, Garner and Yamagishi, University of Edinburgh,
  https://datashare.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/2353), licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
  The voice Siwis (ff_siwis) is its reader's.
- Koniwa's tnc recordings (https://github.com/koniwa/koniwa), licensed under CC BY 3.0:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/.
The model is trained from those recordings, not the recordings themselves.
